@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Digital Watch

state StartWatch
state HourAdjustment
state MinuteAdjustment
state AlarmHourAdjustment
state AlarmMinuteAdjustment
state AlarmOn
state AlarmOff
state LightOn
state LightOff

StartWatch:!
HourAdjustment:!
MinuteAdjustment:!
AlarmHourAdjustment:!
AlarmMinuteAdjustment:!
AlarmOn[*]: HourAdjustment: Adjust Hour: HourAdjustment: AlarmOn
AlarmOff: AlarmOn: Adjust Alarm Off: AlarmOff
LightOn[*]: StartWatch: Light On: LightOn
LightOff: LightOn: Light Off: LightOff


title UML State Machine Diagram - Online College Magazine System

state LoginChoice
state AdminProfileManagement
state ArticleReview
state ContentCreation
state Editing
state AccessDenied
state PublishedArticles
state SearchArticle
state FeedbackProvided

LoginChoice:!
AdminProfileManagement: LoginChoice: Admin Profile Management
ContentCreation: AdminProfileManagement: Create/Edit User Profile
ArticleReview: AdminProfileManagement: Review Articles
Editing: ArticleReview: Edit Articles
AccessDenied: LoginChoice: Access Denied
PublishedArticles: ArticleReview: Publish Articles
SearchArticle: PublishedArticles: Search for More Articles
FeedbackProvided: SearchArticle: Provide Feedback


title UML State Machine Diagram - Smart Traffic Management System

state TrafficMonitoring
state StreetLightControl
state TrafficSignalManagement
state VehicleNumberCapture
state RuleVerification
state NoViolation
state ViolationRecorded
state FinePaid
state WarningSent

TrafficMonitoring:!
StreetLightControl: TrafficMonitoring: Control Street Lights
TrafficSignalManagement: TrafficMonitoring: Manage Traffic Signals
VehicleNumberCapture: TrafficSignalManagement: Capture Vehicle Numbers
RuleVerification: VehicleNumberCapture: Verify Traffic Rules
NoViolation: RuleVerification: No Violation: NoViolation
ViolationRecorded: RuleVerification: Record Violation: ViolationRecorded
FinePaid[*]: ViolationRecorded: Fine Paid: FinePaid
WarningSent[*]: ViolationRecorded: Warning Sent: WarningSent


title UML State Machine Diagram - Online Marketplace

state Registration
state Verification
state SellerWorkspace
state ProductAddition
state ProductPromotion
state CustomerDashboard
state ProductExploration
state ProductViewing
state PurchaseDecision
state Logout

Registration:!
Verification: Registration: Verify Account
SellerWorkspace[*]: Verification: Access Workspace: SellerWorkspace
ProductAddition: SellerWorkspace: Add New Products
ProductPromotion: SellerWorkspace: Promote Existing Products
CustomerDashboard[*]: Verification: Access Dashboard: CustomerDashboard
ProductExploration: CustomerDashboard: Explore Products
ProductViewing: ProductExploration: View Available Products
PurchaseDecision: ProductViewing: Proceed with Purchase or Stop Browsing
Logout: SellerWorkspace: Log Out: Logout

@enduml
